#: ../../faq.md:1 e4b9685ec0be4479bf63f2cbcf4427b8
msgid "📋 FAQ"
msgstr "📋 常见问题"

#: ../../faq.md:3 842694f660e740f49832ef2ed7422a11
msgid "Can anyone use Bookshelf?"
msgstr "我可以在我的项目中使用Bookshelf吗？"

#: ../../faq.md:5 80f081e02fdf411795ef35483d233e03
msgid "Anyone can use Bookshelf in a project. If you can, a mention of Bookshelf is always welcome as it helps keep the open source world a respectful place. You can also share your projects on the [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) server. This shows others how you use Bookshelf and helps keep the community active."
msgstr "任何人都可以在项目中使用 Bookshelf。如果可以，提及 Bookshelf 总是受欢迎的，因为这有助于保持开源世界的尊重。你也可以在 [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) 服务器上分享你的项目。这向其他人展示你如何使用 Bookshelf，并帮助保持社区活跃。"

#: ../../faq.md:7 4044ce2a5ebc4791a351a51f5c102291
msgid "Is it compatible with other datapacks?"
msgstr "是否兼容其他数据包？"

#: ../../faq.md:9 74f63cf8b5ed40b6a031975cb56ccb60
msgid "Yes. Bookshelf follows strict rules to stay compatible with other datapacks. All scores, tags, and resources use namespaces and follow Smithed conventions."
msgstr "是的。Bookshelf 遵循严格规则以保持与其他数据包的兼容性。所有分数、标签和资源都使用命名空间并遵循 Smithed 约定。"

#: ../../faq.md:11 facf08635be345fc8b13cc6c81caa215
msgid "Is it resource-heavy?"
msgstr "资源占用高吗？"

#: ../../faq.md:13 d5d68d265a9941c89da2ccd5ecd99ba5
msgid "🧠 CPU usage"
msgstr "🧠 CPU占用"

#: ../../faq.md:15 39baebc9b485448b956b6c70d08b354c
msgid "Bookshelf is mainly a set of functions that only run when you use them. They don't affect CPU on their own. Their impact depends on how complex the function is and how often you run it."
msgstr "Bookshelf 主要是一组函数，仅在使用时运行。它们本身不会影响 CPU。其影响取决于函数的复杂程度和运行频率。"

#: ../../faq.md:17 3e85aab4ca4b40d29fa1cd724655d53b
msgid "💾 Memory usage"
msgstr "💾 内存占用"

#: ../../faq.md:19 df2a04a6aad343b5a39734ea61708e1b
msgid "Minecraft loads datapacks at startup, so file count has little effect on memory use. Instructions are lightweight, and you can include many functions without increasing RAM needs. Bookshelf's modular design also lets you load only the modules you need."
msgstr "Minecraft在加载时会解析整个数据包，因此文件数量并不重要。指令在内存中非常轻量，即使包含大量函数也不会显著增加RAM占用。此外，Bookshelf的模块化设计使你可以仅选择所需的模块。"

#: ../../faq.md:21 0ec31723aa5e491dbcf9f991851eef1b
msgid "💽 Disk usage"
msgstr "💽 磁盘占用"

#: ../../faq.md:23 08e9db88748443bbb86e4798a52424fb
msgid "Bookshelf comes as compressed zip datapacks. If size matters, use the [Bookshelf Manager](https://mcbookshelf.dev) to download a bundle and pick only the modules you need."
msgstr "Bookshelf 以压缩的 zip 数据包形式提供。如果大小重要，请使用 [Bookshelf Manager](https://mcbookshelf.dev) 下载捆绑包并仅选择你需要的模块。"

#: ../../faq.md:25 dfb7929c654f417d876c8b4dcc39e764
msgid "Are the functions optimized?"
msgstr "函数优化如何？"

#: ../../faq.md:27 cdc08d82877243a1b290dcd53468f18d
msgid "Yes, optimization is a key focus, but Bookshelf aims to be easy to use and flexible. Some design choices may not be fully optimal because of this."
msgstr "是的，优化是关键重点，但 Bookshelf 旨在易于使用和灵活。因此，某些设计选择可能不完全最优。"

#: ../../faq.md:29 25a09a2c37984e0d92c1fc54d88eb8f7
msgid "What about copyrights?"
msgstr "版权问题如何处理？"

#: ../../faq.md:31 8080c08c0fee4f9e91cba3d2cb772415
msgid "You can use Bookshelf in any map or datapack. You can modify it, share your changes, or use it in commercial projects. But modified files must keep the same license. That's why Bookshelf uses the [MPL 2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/blob/master/LICENSE) license."
msgstr "你可以在任何地图或数据包中使用 Bookshelf。你可以修改它、分享你的更改或在商业项目中使用它。但修改后的文件必须保持相同的许可证。这就是 Bookshelf 使用 [MPL 2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/blob/master/LICENSE) 许可证的原因。"

#: ../../faq.md:35 b8c4eea95abb45ccbf0672bf59188403
msgid "More questions? Join us on Discord!"
msgstr "还有疑问？加入我们的Discord社区！"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:4 f61172cf9c3c440cb7b7b060b2bca3ca
msgid "**💬 Did it help you?**"
msgstr "**💬 这对你有帮助吗？**"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:6 d037867e97424692ade594490bf7ec47
msgid "Feel free to leave your questions and feedback below!"
msgstr "欢迎在下方留下你的问题和反馈！"

#~ msgid "Absolutely! Bookshelf is designed to be used in any project. A mention of Bookshelf and/or Gunivers in a message of thanks is always appreciated. Let's keep the open-source world a respectful place 🤗! Additionally, feel free to share your creations with us to let us know how you use the library (and allow us to provide additional visibility to your project)."
#~ msgstr "当然可以！Bookshelf 库被设计用于各种项目。如果你能在致谢中提到 Bookshelf 和/或 Gunivers，我们将非常感激 🤗！让我们共同维护开源世界的友好氛围！此外，欢迎随时向我们分享你的作品，让我们了解你是如何使用该库的（这样我们也能为你的项目提供更多曝光机会）。"

#~ msgid "Yes! Bookshelf adheres to constraints that ensure compatibility with most datapacks. All Bookshelf scores, tags, and namespaces start with `bs.` and use fake players whenever possible to avoid conflicts."
#~ msgstr "是的！Bookshelf遵循多项约束规则，确保与大多数数据包兼容。所有Bookshelf的分数、标签和命名空间均以`bs.`开头，并在可能情况下使用伪玩家(或模拟玩家)以规避冲突。"

#~ msgid "As a library is simply a set of tools that you can call upon, it will not impact CPU performance unless actively used. The CPU impact depends on the functions you invoke and their frequency. The documentation provides warnings and performance tips for functions that may be resource-intensive."
#~ msgstr "作为一个函数库，它本质上是一套可供调用的工具集，除非主动使用，否则不会影响CPU性能。CPU占用取决于你调用的函数及其频率。文档会对可能资源密集型的函数提供警告和性能优化建议。"

#~ msgid "Bookshelf is compressed into a zip file, making it only a few megabytes in size. If size remains a concern, you can selectively choose the modules you need. Additionally, it's recommended to download Bookshelf from GitHub releases, which provide only essential files, rather than directly from the repository."
#~ msgstr "Bookshelf压缩为zip文件后仅有几MB大小。如果仍然关心体积，你可以选择性提取所需模块。建议从GitHub发布页下载（仅包含必需文件），而非直接从代码库下载。"

#~ msgid "Bookshelf prioritizes accessibility and versatility. While this may occasionally result in choices that are not the most optimized for a specific context, they align with the library's objectives. Nevertheless, optimization is continually considered, and suggestions and pull requests to enhance Bookshelf are welcomed. If you have ideas for improvement (optimization, accessibility, or otherwise), please share them with us!"
#~ msgstr "Bookshelf优先考虑易用性和多功能性。虽然这可能导致某些设计在特定场景下并非最优，但符合函数库的核心目标。我们持续进行优化改进，欢迎提出优化建议和提交PR。无论是对性能、易用性或其他方面的改进想法，都请与我们分享！"

#~ msgid "Bookshelf is licensed to allow you to use and modify it for personal use and distribute maps or datapacks that use Bookshelf without any issues, as long as you share any modification made to the original source code. For that, we chose the [MPL 2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/blob/master/LICENSE) (Mozilla Public License 2.0)."
#~ msgstr "Bookshelf采用[MPL 2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/blob/master/LICENSE)(Mozilla公共许可证2.0)授权。你可自由使用和修改它制作个人项目，并分发包含Bookshelf的地图或数据包，唯一要求是共享对源代码的任何修改。"
